    "detailed_description": "Will you fall in love with the devils?<br />\r\nIn Shikou-cho, the devils and the vampires are secretly vying for the Grimoire in the dark.<br />\r\nHow will the devils deal with the upcoming occurrences? <br />\r\nAnd what the future holds for you two after falling in love?<br />\r\nKnown as a highly popular game, Dance with Devils, the FD version is about to unfold! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa A story with rich variations<br />\r\nFrom lively stories featuring all the characters,<br />\r\nTo sweet tales of life after becoming lovers,<br />\r\nAnd all kinds of epilogues after endings\u2014<br />\r\nChoose and enjoy your favorite from various storylines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Choices: Human or Devil?<br />\r\nMake a choice in front of your devilish lover!<br />\r\nDialogues in every option were all recorded with dummy head mic.<br />\r\nWhich one will you choose, Human or Devil?<br />\r\nPlease enjoy his different reactions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Special Voice Collection<br />\r\nFrom sweet whispers to various anecdotes,<br />\r\nEnjoy special voices from all characters.<br />\r\nUnfold the stories, collect points, and unlock voices!<br />\r\nJek, Azuna, and Pomeranian will also be in this special voice collection!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, brand new exquisite illustrations and card collections are also on the way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Theme Song with devils featuring<br />\r\n\u300c\u5149\u308cCAROL\u300d<br />\r\nLyrics: Daisuke Iwasaki<br />\r\nComposition: Junpei Fujita (Elements Garden)<br />\r\nArrangement: Yuta Kasai (Elements Garden)<br />\r\nPerformed by: PENTACLE\u2605\u2605 (Vo. Soma Saito, Wataru Hatano, Takashi Kondo, Subaru Kimura, Daisuke Hirakawa, Tatsuhisa Suzuki)",
    "about_the_game": "Will you fall in love with the devils?<br />\r\nIn Shikou-cho, the devils and the vampires are secretly vying for the Grimoire in the dark.<br />\r\nHow will the devils deal with the upcoming occurrences? <br />\r\nAnd what the future holds for you two after falling in love?<br />\r\nKnown as a highly popular game, Dance with Devils, the FD version is about to unfold! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa A story with rich variations<br />\r\nFrom lively stories featuring all the characters,<br />\r\nTo sweet tales of life after becoming lovers,<br />\r\nAnd all kinds of epilogues after endings\u2014<br />\r\nChoose and enjoy your favorite from various storylines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Choices: Human or Devil?<br />\r\nMake a choice in front of your devilish lover!<br />\r\nDialogues in every option were all recorded with dummy head mic.<br />\r\nWhich one will you choose, Human or Devil?<br />\r\nPlease enjoy his different reactions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Special Voice Collection<br />\r\nFrom sweet whispers to various anecdotes,<br />\r\nEnjoy special voices from all characters.<br />\r\nUnfold the stories, collect points, and unlock voices!<br />\r\nJek, Azuna, and Pomeranian will also be in this special voice collection!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdditionally, brand new exquisite illustrations and card collections are also on the way!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25aa Theme Song with devils featuring<br />\r\n\u300c\u5149\u308cCAROL\u300d<br />\r\nLyrics: Daisuke Iwasaki<br />\r\nComposition: Junpei Fujita (Elements Garden)<br />\r\nArrangement: Yuta Kasai (Elements Garden)<br />\r\nPerformed by: PENTACLE\u2605\u2605 (Vo. Soma Saito, Wataru Hatano, Takashi Kondo, Subaru Kimura, Daisuke Hirakawa, Tatsuhisa Suzuki)",
